v 3
d webdoc2. Bootstrap-5 reporting wrapper for Ben Jann's webdoc -- HTML reports
d from Stata with minimal HTML coding.
d
d webdoc2 is a post-processor and shortcut suite for webdoc that makes literate
d HTML reporting from a do-file fast: shorthand tags for headings, paragraphs,
d collapsible code/graph accordions, navbars with dropdowns, in-page TOC,
d images, lists, page width, and iframes for embedded dashboards.
d
d Requires: Stata 14+, and webdoc (from SSC) by Ben Jann.
d
d KW: webdoc
d KW: html
d KW: bootstrap
d KW: reporting
d KW: literate programming
d KW: reproducible research
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d Distribution-Date: 20260526
d
